# IntelliJ / Android Studio project state — entirely IDE-local. New AS
# versions keep adding files (appInsightsSettings.xml, studiobot.xml, …)
# that are noise in diffs and confusing for F-Droid reviewers (the
# Crashlytics-tab placeholder in appInsightsSettings.xml in particular
# looked like a tracker integration when it isn't). Blanket exclude.
/.idea/
.DS_Store
/build
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
local.properties
.kotlin
mobile_clients/android/build/
shared/build/
build/
mobile_clients/android/src/main/assets/workouts_private*.json
keystore.properties
forge.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
# Scratch git worktrees created by Claude Code for isolated work. The rest of
# .claude/ (launch.json, settings.json) is deliberately tracked.
/.claude/worktrees/

# Live Ride API design notes. Unpublished planning for the real-time ride
# API: the protocol is a public contract once it ships, so the document
# stays local until the shape is settled rather than reading as committed
# intent to anyone who clones the repo.
/docs/LIVE_API.md

# Google Play service-account key, read by fastlane supply (see
# mobile_clients/android/fastlane/Appfile). Same treatment as
# keystore.properties and forge.properties: a credential, at the repo root,
# never committed.
play-service-account.json

# fastlane run artefacts.
mobile_clients/android/fastlane/report.xml
mobile_clients/android/fastlane/README.md

# Python bytecode, from running the companion test harness in scripts/.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
